{title: Vaseegara}
{artist: Bombay Jayashri Harris Jayaraj}
{key: Am}

{c: Verse 1}
[Am]vaseegaraa en nenjinikka
[Am]un pon [G]madiyil thoonginaal poadhum
[Am]adhae kaNam en kaNNuRanga mun
[Am]jenmangaLin [G]aekkangaL theerum
[Am]naan [G]naesippadhum [F]suvaasippadhum
[G]un [Am]dhayavaal thaanae
[G]aengugiRaen [F]aengugiRaen
[E]un ninaivaal [Am]naanae naan
[Am]adai mazhai varum adhil nanaivoamae
[Em]kuLir kaaychchaloadhu snekam
[Dm]oru [C]poarvaikkuL [E]iru thookkam
[Am]kuLu kuLu poygaL solli enai velvaay
[Em]adhu therindhum kooda anbae
[Dm]manam [C]adhaiyaedhaan [E]edhirpaarkkum
[Am]engaeyum [Em]poagaamal
[F]dhinam veettilaeyae [G]nee vaendum
[Am]sila [G]samayam viLaiyaattaay
[Dm]un aadaikkuL [E]naan vaendum
[Am]dhinam nee kuLiththadhum enaith thaedi
[Em]en saelai nuniyaal undhan
[Dm]thalai [C]thudaippaayae [E]adhu kavidhai
[Am]thirudan poal padhungiyae dhideer enru
[Em]pinnaalirundhu ennai
[Dm]nee [C]aNaippaayae [E]adhu kavidhai
[Am]yaaraenum [Em]maNi kaettaal
[F]adhai solla [G]kooda theriyaadhae
[Am]kaadhalenum [G]mudivinile
[Dm]gadigaara [E]naeram kidaiyaadhae
